note: loop each walks the items it started with
list xs = [1, 2, 3]
loop each number x in xs do:
    if x < 3 do:
        add x + 10 to xs
    end
    print(x)
end
print(xs)

note: a key removed during the loop is still visited, and is gone afterwards
map m = {"a": 1, "b": 2, "c": 3}
loop each str key in m do:
    remove "c" from m
    print(key)
end
print(m)
